CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'ms_card->pre_dir != srb->sc_data_direction'
#122: FILE: drivers/staging/rts5208/ms.c:3015:
+		if ((ms_card->pre_dir != srb->sc_data_direction) ||
+		    ((ms_card->pre_sec_addr + ms_card->pre_sec_cnt) !=
+		     start_sector) ||
+		    (mode_2k && (ms_card->seq_mode & MODE_512_SEQ)) ||
+		    (!mode_2k && (ms_card->seq_mode & MODE_2K_SEQ)) ||
+		    !(val & MS_INT_BREQ) ||
+		    ((ms_card->total_sec_cnt + sector_cnt) > 0xFE00)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

